estion/worked-solution "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int\\left(2x^{5}+\\frac{1}{x^{4}}-\\frac{6}{\\sqrt[7]{x^{8}}}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\int\\left(2x^{5}+x^{-4}-6x^{\\frac{-8}{7}}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= 2\\int x^{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int x^{-4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x-6\\int x^{\\frac{-8}{7}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= 2\\left(\\frac{x^{5+1}}{(5+1)}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{x^{-4+1}}{(-4+1)}\\right)\\\\ &\\quad -6\\left(\\frac{x^{\\frac{-8}{7}+1}}{(\\frac{-8}{7}+1)}\\right)+C\\\\ &= \\frac{x^{6}}{3}-\\frac{1}{3x^{3}}+\\frac{42}{\\sqrt[7]{x}}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "c7b48c65-5e5b-586a-af84-38b8bafff23c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c7b48c65-5e5b-586a-af84-38b8bafff23c" :question/answer-fields "4c63ed41-ff98-562b-9155-b0554d9bc05e"] [:db/ensure "c7b48c65-5e5b-586a-af84-38b8bafff23c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184155 :knowledge-point/questions "c7b48c65-5e5b-586a-af84-38b8bafff23c"] [:db/add "cfc99332-9b17-5d58-8af7-2a7308dc6928" :answer/id #uuid "cfc99332-9b17-5d58-8af7-2a7308dc6928"] [:db/add "cfc99332-9b17-5d58-8af7-2a7308dc6928" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cfc99332-9b17-5d58-8af7-2a7308dc6928" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{x}+\\frac{6x^{4}}{5}+\\frac{12\\sqrt[3]{x^{5}}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "cfc99332-9b17-5d58-8af7-2a7308dc6928" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9ad435ba-c8ba-50c2-b5b3-e5b4219e660e" :answer/id #uuid "9ad435ba-c8ba-50c2-b5b3-e5b4219e660e"] [:db/add "9ad435ba-c8ba-50c2-b5b3-e5b4219e660e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9ad435ba-c8ba-50c2-b5b3-e5b4219e660e" :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{x}+\\frac{3x^{4}}{2}+\\frac{12}{5\\sqrt[3]{x}}+C"] [:db/ensure "9ad435ba-c8ba-50c2-b5b3-e5b4219e660e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "be2c096e-451f-52f5-a1a1-954febf897cb" :answer/id #uuid "be2c096e-451f-52f5-a1a1-954febf897cb"] [:db/add "be2c096e-451f-52f5-a1a1-954febf897cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "be2c096e-451f-52f5-a1a1-954febf897cb" :answer/value "-\\f